<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>동적으로 Submission 제어하기(생성,삭제,실행)</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_0fbf97ca4c8e7236" class="chapter_title">동적으로 Submission 제어하기(생성,삭제,실행)</h1><h1 id="r_33c450958546fbc6" class="element heading1" data-element-id="33c450958546fbc6"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_0b80811c02250288" class="element pre" data-element-id="0b80811c02250288">스크립트로 Submission을 생성, 삭제, 실행, 및 Submission의 객체를 반환받는 예제입니다.
공통 스크립트 작성 시 주로 사용됩니다.</pre><p id="r_7e9f5a5c4e1f27a6" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="7e9f5a5c4e1f27a6"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00030">P00030</a></p><h1 id="r_f383af694106644d" class="element heading1" data-element-id="f383af694106644d"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_bc825dfcd8c0bae4" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="bc825dfcd8c0bae4"><li><p>Submission 생성하기</p></li><li><p>Submission 삭제하기</p></li><li><p>Submission 실행하기</p></li><li><p>Submission 객체의 정보 반환받기</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_8ae3065d7094f90d" class="element heading1" data-element-id="8ae3065d7094f90d"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><p id="r_a01b8d13dab423c7" class="element normal" data-element-id="a01b8d13dab423c7">예제 영역 '<span class="r_blue001_span">로그 확인</span>'의 textarea와 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔에 실행 결과 값이 출력됩니다.</p><div id="r_1b03295efdad15a8" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="1b03295efdad15a8"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Log</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[10:31:56] ** scwin.btn_ex1_onclick 실행 **
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[10:31:57] ** scwin.btn_ex2_onclick 실행 **
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[10:31:57] "sbm_example1" ID를 가진 submission이 이미 삭제된 경우는 오류가 발생합니다. 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔을 확인하세요.
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[10:31:57] $p.deleteSubmission("sbm_example1");
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[10:31:57] 정상적으로 삭제되었습니다.</pre></div><h2 id="r_50246acd7d34ba9f" class="element heading2" data-element-id="50246acd7d34ba9f"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>Submission 생성하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_b5330ea2ab53d53d" class="element step1" data-element-id="b5330ea2ab53d53d"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_btn_style_span">새로고침</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_b4f0b27b81bf26ed" class="element step1" data-element-id="b4f0b27b81bf26ed"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">실행1</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><pre id="r_80b10d27d262542c" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="80b10d27d262542c">Submission을 생성합니다.</pre><div id="r_7db34ae1f359e867" class="element step1" data-element-id="7db34ae1f359e867"><p class="step1_n">3</p><p>STEP 3: 생성된 객체의 정보를 확인하기 위해 '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">실행4</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_ed28d5920109f0dd" class="element step1" data-element-id="ed28d5920109f0dd"><p class="step1_n">4</p><p>STEP 4: 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔로 반환된 객체를 확인합니다.</p></div><div id="r_6bd3e19e0f1da53f" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="6bd3e19e0f1da53f"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 2.</span>Log</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:55:57] ** scwin.btn_ex1_onclick 실행 **
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:55:59] ** scwin.btn_ex4_onclick 실행 **
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:55:59] $p.getSubmission("sbm_example1");
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:55:59] "sbm_example1" ID를 가진 submission객체가 반환됩니다. 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔을 확인하세요.
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:55:59] action : /data/sampleData/sampleData_json_dc_list.json
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:55:59] ref : data:json,dma_request</pre></div><h2 id="r_27fddf701cc9ef3f" class="element heading2" data-element-id="27fddf701cc9ef3f"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.2</span><span>Submission 삭제하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_7d6df23e28c27109" class="element step1" data-element-id="7d6df23e28c27109"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_btn_style_span">새로고침</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_8f1c0c14a6ed79ea" class="element step1" data-element-id="8f1c0c14a6ed79ea"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">실행2</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><pre id="r_545137adcabb291a" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="545137adcabb291a">Submission을 삭제합니다.</pre><div id="r_afedab0292b3814d" class="element step1" data-element-id="afedab0292b3814d"><p class="step1_n">3</p><p>STEP 3: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">실행4</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_7dc646332de586a4" class="element step1" data-element-id="7dc646332de586a4"><p class="step1_n">4</p><p>STEP 4: 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔로 반환된 객체를 확인합니다.</p></div><pre id="r_627aad94e6c21aee" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="627aad94e6c21aee">삭제된 Submission의 정보를 확인합니다.</pre><div id="r_6fc9f74b55c69ffe" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="6fc9f74b55c69ffe"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 3.</span>Log</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:56:35] ** scwin.btn_ex2_onclick 실행 **
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:56:35] "sbm_example1" ID를 가진 submission이 이미 삭제된 경우는 오류가 발생합니다. 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔을 확인하세요.
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:56:35] $p.deleteSubmission("sbm_example1");
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:56:35] 정상적으로 삭제되었습니다.
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:56:36] ** scwin.btn_ex4_onclick 실행 **
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:56:36] $p.getSubmission("sbm_example1");
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:56:36] "sbm_example1" ID를 가진 submission객체가 반환됩니다. 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔을 확인하세요.
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[13:56:36] "sbm_example1" ID를 가진 submission객체를 찾을 수 없습니다.</pre></div><h2 id="r_50f25b26a71a3bf4" class="element heading2" data-element-id="50f25b26a71a3bf4"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.3</span><span>Submission 실행하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_a36720b7d4392413" class="element step1" data-element-id="a36720b7d4392413"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_btn_style_span">새로고침</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_8129220ec9995fb8" class="element step1" data-element-id="8129220ec9995fb8"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">실행3</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><pre id="r_76c5907ac00b9f62" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="76c5907ac00b9f62">Submission을 실행합니다.</pre><div id="r_97b386551fb30fb3" class="element step1" data-element-id="97b386551fb30fb3"><p class="step1_n">3</p><p>STEP 3: 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔에 출력된 응답 데이터를 확인합니다.</p></div><div id="r_2c4ab278617e10f9" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="2c4ab278617e10f9"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 4.</span>Log</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>[15:57:54] ** scwin.btn_ex3_onclick 실행 **
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>[15:57:54] $p.executeSubmission("sbm_example1");
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>[15:57:54] "sbm_example1" ID를 가진 submission이 없는 경고 로그가 출력됩니다. 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔을 확인하세요.
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>[15:57:54] submitDoneHandler
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>[15:57:54] { "dc_resUserListData":
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"name":"USER-01"
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, "birthday" : "19710405"
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, "height" : "164"
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, "weight" : "58"
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, "gender" : "F"
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;},{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"name":"USER-02"
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, "birthday" : "19900905"
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, "height" : "164"
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, "weight" : "47"
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, "gender" : "F"
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}]
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>}</pre></div><h2 id="r_a88a328afd9f0526" class="element heading2" data-element-id="a88a328afd9f0526"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.4</span><span>Submission 객체의 정보 반환받기</span></div></h2><div id="r_6b1c412aef1897b6" class="element step1" data-element-id="6b1c412aef1897b6"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_btn_style_span">새로고침</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_5923f3850b180613" class="element step1" data-element-id="5923f3850b180613"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">실행4</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_f68394c4cc073df0" class="element step1" data-element-id="f68394c4cc073df0"><p class="step1_n">3</p><p>STEP 3: 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔에 출력된 반환 값을 확인합니다.</p></div><div id="r_fdf0ec251c294027" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="fdf0ec251c294027"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 5.</span>Log</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[16:00:03] ** scwin.btn_ex4_onclick 실행 **
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[16:00:03] $p.getSubmission("sbm_example1");
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[16:00:03] "sbm_example1" ID를 가진 submission객체가 반환됩니다. 브라우저 개발자 도구의 콘솔을 확인하세요.
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[16:00:03] action : /data/sampleData/sampleData_json_dc_list.json
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>[16:00:03] ref : data:json,dma_request</pre></div><h1 id="r_fe1c643ca97987af" class="element heading1" data-element-id="fe1c643ca97987af"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_acaed003cf6053aa" class="element heading2" data-element-id="acaed003cf6053aa"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>Submission 생성하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_14cb2c62866ba356" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="14cb2c62866ba356"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 6.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//옵션 설정.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">var</span> jsnSubmissionOptions = {
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;id : <span class="r_h_string_span">"sbm_example1"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ref : <span class="r_h_string_span">"data:json,dma_request"</span>,              <span class="r_h_comment_span">//생략 가능 - $p.executeSubmission 호출시 request data 전달이 가능합니다. </span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;target : <span class="r_h_string_span">"data:json,dc_resUserListData"</span>,    <span class="r_h_comment_span">//생략 가능 - submitDoneHandler 메소드에서 response data의 제어가 가능합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;action : <span class="r_h_string_span">"/data/sampleData/sampleData_json_dc_list.json"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;mediatype : <span class="r_h_string_span">"application/json"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;submitDoneHandler : scwin.example_submitDoneHandler,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;submitErrorHandler : scwin.example_submitErrorHandler
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>};
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//submission 생성</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>$p.createSubmission( jsnSubmissionOptions );</pre></div><p id="r_289cbd2063103eca" class="element normal" data-element-id="289cbd2063103eca">아래는 이벤트 핸들러를 정의 예시입니다.</p><div id="r_a3e7de9ba51cf4c5" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="a3e7de9ba51cf4c5"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 7.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//submssion의 submitDoneHandler</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>scwin.example_submitDoneHandler = <span class="r_h_keyword_span">function</span> (e) {
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">//응답 본문 console 출력</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;console.log(e.responseText);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">//응답 객체 console 출력</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;console.log(e.responseJSON);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>};
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//submision의 submitErrorHandler</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>scwin.example_submitErrorHandler = <span class="r_h_keyword_span">function</span> (e) {
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">//개발자 도구 console에 에러 객체 출력</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;console.error(<span class="r_h_string_span">"submitErrorHandler"</span>, e);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>};</pre></div><h2 id="r_14533d8bdc239634" class="element heading2" data-element-id="14533d8bdc239634"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.2</span><span>Submission 삭제하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_14b9cce3e6ca3d35" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="14b9cce3e6ca3d35"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 8.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//submission 삭제. - "sbm_example1" ID를 가진 submission을 삭제합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>$p.deleteSubmission(<span class="r_h_string_span">"sbm_example1"</span>);</pre></div><div id="r_0663978b6134d8c8" class="element caution" data-element-id="0663978b6134d8c8"><p>존재하지 않는 submission인 경우 오류 로그가 출력됩니다. 오류 로그만 출력하고 이후 로직은 수행이 되지만 해당 로그 출력을 원하지 않는 경우는 '$p.deleteSubmission' 호출 전 '$p.getSubmission' API를 통해 존재 유무를 판단 후 '$p.deleteSubmission' API를 호출하면 됩니다.</p></div><h2 id="r_c25a20159ea78ecb" class="element heading2" data-element-id="c25a20159ea78ecb"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.3</span><span>Submission 실행하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_2eb8320ab0e00474" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="2eb8320ab0e00474"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 9.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//submission 실행. - "sbm_example1" ID를 가진 submission을 실행합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>$p.executeSubmission(<span class="r_h_string_span">"sbm_example1"</span>);</pre></div><h2 id="r_ebc2d4a3a947eeee" class="element heading2" data-element-id="ebc2d4a3a947eeee"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.4</span><span>Submission 객체의 정보 반환받기</span></div></h2><div id="r_0ee31735a4b8201e" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="0ee31735a4b8201e"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 10.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//submisison 객체 반환 - "sbm_example1" ID를 가진 submission을 반환합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//반환 받은 객체의 속성을 재정의하여 사용할 수 있습니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">var</span> objSubmission = $p.getSubmission(<span class="r_h_string_span">"sbm_example1"</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">if</span> (!objSubmission) {
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">//반환된 submission객체가 없는 경우 - null 반환</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>} <span class="r_h_keyword_span">else</span> {
